title: Start
---
// Globals
<<debug_find "InventoryTitle">>
<<debug_find "ItemCigarettes">>
<<debug_find "QuestTitleFindYourCar">>


<<declare $goodPoints = 0>>
<<declare $badPoints = 0>>

<<declare $copTrust = 0>>

<<declare $hasBeer = true>>
<<declare $hasCigarette = true>>

<<declare $beliefGod = false>>

<<declare $quest = "unassigned">>

// Policeman Variables
<<declare $firstPoliceTalkCompleted = false>>
<<declare $gotBunkerInfo = false>>

// Bunker 16
<<declare $isRadioOn = false>>
<<declare $haveTalkedToMaple15 = false>>
<<declare $hasBeenRejected = false>>
<<declare $PickedName = "">>
<<declare $haveTalkedToLiepajas15 = false>>

// Church Bunker
<<set $haveTalkedToChurch = false>>

// Bridge
<<declare $gotBridgeInfo = false>>
<<declare $planksFound = 0>>
<<declare $bridgeFixed = false>>

<<jump LakeIntro>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        CHAPTER 1 - LAKE INTRO
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: LakeIntro
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>

<<camera "WideLakeShot">>
<<wait 3>>
// Ambient sounds nature

You: What a nice day. No kids, no wife, just me and my mosquitoes.
// Static Camera Shot on beer
<<wait 1>>
<<camera "BeerCloseup">>

You: Today's a little too hot... but this still beats almost anything.
// Wide Shot of the lake
<<wait 2>>

<<camera "WideLakeShot2">>

You feel like an egg being cracked on to a frying pan
You feel like T-posing all day would be so nice

<<wait 2>>
....

<<camera "PlayerCloseup">>

You: *Start using T-pose powers to drink beer*
<<play_animation "DrinkingBeer" "DrinkBeerAnimation" true>>

<<wait 1>>
Nature: *Angry Sounds*
You: Sorry

<<wait 1>>

As you are enjoying this day, something feels off
<<wait 2>>

<<jump MeteorAlert>>
===

//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                        CHAPTER 2 - METEOR ALERT
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: MeteorAlert
---
// Siren starts
//<<run_command "PlaySiren">>

<<wait 3>>

<<camera "WideLakeShot">>

System: WARNING! WARNING! A meteor is incoming.
System: Impact event expected in five minutes
System: Seek shelter immediately

<<camera "PlayerCloseup">>

You: Oh shit. What the hell?
You: Wait a minute!

<<camera "FocusSun">>

...
You: Is it becoming darker or am I going blind? I haven't drunk any moonshine today...
You: Something is in front of the sun? Is it the meteor?
There is nothing.. just damage to your eyes

You: Time to move.

You grab your last beers and a cigarette and get a move on

<<camera "PlayerCam">>

<<enable_controls "Player">>
<<show_text "ItemCigarettes">>
<<show_text "ItemBeer2">>
<<show_text "QuestTitleFindYourCar">>
<<show_text "InventoryTitle">>

// Start game countdown timer (or not)
//<<run_command "StartTimer">>

You: Time to get out of here.
===

