//------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                       OLD MAN HUT
//------------------------------------------------------------------------
title: DirectionsToOldMan
---
Person: Oh what do you think is happening to the old man, can you check?
Person: Hopefully he got to safety
Person: You can check him out at Liepajas 7 (whatever) // There should be a sign there but fallen over, hard to find, behind rock
Person: It is more of a forest with a hut at the end

Old Man: Got money?
-> Give money
    <<set $goodPoints += 1>>
    Old Man: Alright... I'll go.
-> Ignore
    <<set $badPoints += 1>>

you keeep going
===

